    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce1e1cc517e8eb47825f6adc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白阿尔丹要在哪个舞台名垂青史。\n在她进入经典级的时候，\n我就已经自己决定好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6177d1db2f175f8f17ddd9df30ec862284a48441326d6ee872f547e623ab05d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
