    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bc5bf769b641dc858a9314a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "许多赛马娘都向往那里，朝那里奔驰。\n一生一次的极致瞬间，符合这个条件的\n比赛，只有“日本德比”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ba99fd475084c72cd5174ae8b7f69179fed3553de67934e917e57c5fcae9d83",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071304.json",
      "json_path": [
