      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然赞成将心力集中在“日本德比”上，\n但没事先准备就直接挑战还是太危险了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bdd7f3ae62f321dde820a48d2de9fdfc2ddb2961ef29df9d59a221425cc07a7",
