      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了尽可能地提高胜算，\n我想先设定一个中期目标，\n为“日本德比”累积经验……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ece5f04c54882fce0f80288ce3512e5bb7fc9680eee80cb1983b5a6df2919cf6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
