      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“青叶赏”的赛场和“日本德比”一样，\n正好适合当成前哨战，\n也能用比赛结果来评估状况。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80098e2de3425872b0a256bd4526f17eb4fec696c082b79edecff4dc44c92b1b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
