      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "再加上那是GⅡ比赛，\n负担应该会比三冠路线的GⅠ少。\n最适合当成中期目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b6d22ecad2075b749711fbaa2acd6c4af65cf21656cbed3585296acead82d16",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
